▶ September 12 flight audit replay
  ✔ UA1532: preserves departure facts when no position is available (7627.680584ms)
  ✔ AA3008: preserves departure facts when no position is available (25.110472ms)
  ✔ keeps pushback registered when a moving aircraft pauses near its stand (104.511865ms)
  ✔ does not invent ORD to LAX when the route feeds have no flight (5.00795ms)
  ✔ does not use an old flight-number route when the current schedule feed is unavailable (1.795873ms)
