  ✔ WN363: fresh surface telemetry contradicts a premature provider takeoff (32.684023ms)
  ✔ WN1035: fresh surface telemetry contradicts a premature provider takeoff (43.756024ms)
  ✔ WN102: fresh surface telemetry contradicts a premature provider takeoff (24.018758ms)
✔ MDW departure surface-stage replays (100.774179ms)
▶ ground trace freshness
  ✔ accepts recent movement but rejects stale and future movement (1.045224ms)
✔ ground trace freshness (1.144384ms)
