  ✔ recognizes WN1266 runway-area fix as already away from the passenger gates (0.24848ms)
  ✔ does not call a terminal-side stationary fix away from the gate area (0.086099ms)
  ✔ does not infer movement from a remote position hours before the departure window (0.045098ms)
✔ MDW fresh ground position can advance the stage (0.487039ms)
