  ✔ shares each section date across Scheduled, Estimated and Actual labels (1.677802ms)
  ✔ honors explicit later dates across midnight and month rollover (0.420635ms)
  ✔ keeps labels without a preceding section date unconfirmed (0.196795ms)
  ✔ still rejects invalid clocks and unknown timezone abbreviations (0.197784ms)
  ⚠ loads an exact route from a FlightStats-style public status page (1.348709ms) # Held #6: unknown-airport route support — https://github.com/jarndtphoto/Inbound/blob/codex/test-suite-cleanup/docs/test-cleanup-held-bugs.md#6-zrh--unknown-airport-public-route-support
  ✔ parses public scheduled and actual gate times when FlightStats exposes them (0.259843ms)
